   syntax: #tickset {<arg>}
   With no argument, it resets the ticker as if a tick had occurred.
   With an argument of 'on', it turns on the ticker.
   With an argument of 'off', it turns off the ticker.
   With an argument of 'toggle', it toggles the ticker on/off.
   With an argument of 'clear', it clears the tickaction and the time.
   With an argument of 'status', it shows the complete status.
   With a numeric argument, the tick amount is set to that number.
   With any other argument, the tick action is set to that command.

   ex:
      #tickset on
      #tickset 60
      #tickset say hello
      #tickset clear
